<title>ARGENTINA: Argentine vegoil export prices July 7.</title>
<headline>Argentine vegoil export prices July 7.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1997-07-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Argentine vegoil export offer/bid prices were as follows, traders said. (FOB in U.S.</p>
<p>dollars per tonne, or basis nearby CBOT contract).</p>
<p>     Soy oil    Jul 523/518 Aug +190/+165 Sep +145/+120</p>
<p>		    Oct/Nov/Dec +150/+100</p>
<p>     Sunoil     Jul 525/528 Aug 527/520 Sep -/-5</p>
<p>((-- Buenos Aires Newsroom +541 318-0655))</p>
</text>
